      "payload": {
        "progress": "edit.ts: fails fast (USAGE_ERROR, exit 2) when falling back to vi/notepad on a non-TTY, naming update --parent/--blocks/--owner/--relates-to as the alternative; explicit VISUAL/EDITOR still works even off a TTY. update.ts: extended with --blocks (cycle-checked, mirrors --relates-to), --owner (set/replace), --parent (reparent + descendant root_id/path cascade via recomputeAncestry, mirrors edit.ts's own reparent path). Added 30+ regression tests (edit.test.ts, tickets/update.test.ts, cli/commands/update.test.ts incl. spawned-CLI coverage). Full suite (1935 tests) + coverage thresholds + lint/typecheck/format/build all pass."
      },
